{"seq":5,"slug":"color-grading-craft","title":"调色工艺","stage":"DONE","category":"photography-video","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft","rating":{"composite":3.67,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"调色工艺-简介\">调色工艺 简介</h1><p>调色工艺（Color Grading Craft）是影视后期制作中将技术控制与艺术表达融为一体的核心环节。本 Hub 系统梳理从基础校正到创意调色、从工具操作到 HDR 宽色域适配的完整知识体系，帮助学习者建立专业调色工作流的系统认知。</p>\n<p>调色工艺的学习路径遵循&quot;先正确、再美观&quot;的原则：首先通过一次校正（Primary Correction）还原画面的物理真实性，然后通过创意调色（Creative Grading）赋予画面情绪和风格，再借助专业工具的节点系统和版本管理实现高效工作流，最后面向 HDR 和宽色域等前沿显示技术进行适配输出。</p>\n<p>本 Hub 包含四个章节：一次校正、创意调色、调色流程工具、HDR 与宽色域，共 12 篇文档覆盖调色工艺的核心知识点。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"color-correction","title":"一次校正","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/color-correction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"white-balance-correction","title":"白平衡校正与色温还原","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/color-correction/white-balance-correction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"exposure-contrast","title":"曝光与对比度修正","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/color-correction/exposure-contrast"},{"seq":3,"slug":"color-balance","title":"色彩平衡还原与肤色保护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/color-correction/color-balance"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"creative-grading","title":"创意调色","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/creative-grading","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lut","title":"LUT 原理与应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/creative-grading/lut"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tone-mapping-style","title":"色调映射与风格化技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/creative-grading/tone-mapping-style"},{"seq":3,"slug":"visual-narrative","title":"风格化处理与视觉叙事","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/creative-grading/visual-narrative"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"grading-workflow","title":"调色流程工具","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/grading-workflow","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"node-system","title":"DaVinci Resolve 节点系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/grading-workflow/node-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"split-screen-reference","title":"分屏对比与参考工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/grading-workflow/split-screen-reference"},{"seq":3,"slug":"version-management","title":"版本管理与调色协作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/grading-workflow/version-management"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"hdr-wide-gamut","title":"HDR 与宽色域","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/hdr-wide-gamut","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hdr-standards","title":"HDR 标准体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/hdr-wide-gamut/hdr-standards"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wide-color-gamut","title":"宽色域色彩空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/hdr-wide-gamut/wide-color-gamut"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-format-delivery","title":"多格式交付与适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/hdr-wide-gamut/multi-format-delivery"}]}]}